  "description": "UTF-8 frame <=4096B. Preserves v1/v2/v3 behavior; LOCAL_RECORD_SYNC requires explicit recordSyncEnabled. Raw canonical completed record <=8192B, <=8 codepoint-safe parts of <=1024B, fixed30000ms deadline. OFFER always NEED/full raw; final ACK only after exact canonical DB persistence. SHA256 identifies full raw facts; CRC32 per part detects accidental corruption only. Local Session ID is exact sourceInstallationId:ordinal, ordinal<=9007199254740991.",
